  "title": "Implies — truth 00",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Implies — truth 00",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Relier les contrôles aux ports nommés, puis lancer Run. Les types et valeurs sont explicites; sélectionner la fiche n'exécute rien.\nEntrées : a (bool) = false; b (bool) = false.\nRésultats attendus : result (bool) = true.\n\nBoolean or non-complex numeric scalars, arrays and clusters are accepted.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\nExpected:\noutput-result (bool) = true\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
